442 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 322 0 R
/T (This project is significant for four groups of stakeholders. For recruiters, it provides a structured, multi- metric shortlisting mechanism rather than reliance on college reputation alone. For placement cells, it provides a comparative benchmarking reference against tier, branch and state peers. For institutions and management, it identifies observed associations between institutional characteristics and placement outcomes that may inform strategic improvement. For students, it provides visibility into branch-level and skill-related employability patterns that may inform academic and career planning. )
/E (This project is significant for four groups of stakeholders. For recruiters, it provides a structured, multi- metric shortlisting mechanism rather than reliance on college reputation alone. For placement cells, it provides a comparative benchmarking reference against tier, branch and state peers. For institutions and management, it identifies observed associations between institutional characteristics and placement outcomes that may inform strategic improvement. For students, it provides visibility into branch-level and skill-related employability patterns that may inform academic and career planning. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [26]
>>
