1381 0 obj
<<
/Title (Engineering colleges in India vary considerably in placement performance, employability outcomes, internship participation and average starting salary. Recruiters, placement cells, students and institutional management often lack a consolidated, data-driven view that connects these outcomes to branch, tier, ownership, category, state and skill-related factors. This project addresses that gap by building an analytical dataset of 22,386 records across 2,813 unique colleges, 33 states, 7 engineering branches, 26 categories, 7 ownership types and 4 tiers, and by developing a Power BI decision-support framework on top of it.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 52 0 R
/Next 2198 0 R
>>
endobj
