/Title (Placement outcomes are among the most closely tracked performance measures for engineering colleges in India. Students, parents, recruiters and accreditation bodies routinely use placement percentage and average salary as proxies for institutional quality. However, placement performance is not uniform: it varies substantially by engineering branch, institutional tier, ownership type, category and state. Despite this variation being widely acknowledged informally, structured, data-driven analysis that connects placement outcomes to employability, internship participation, salary and skill-alignment factors at scale)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2609 0 R
/Next 3089 0 R
>>
endobj
2920 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project responds to that gap by constructing a cleaned, analysis-ready dataset of engineering college placement records and building an Exploratory Data Analysis \(EDA\) and Power BI-based decision-support framework around it.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2609 0 R
/Prev 3089 0 R
>>
endobj
