/Title (The scope of this project is limited to the 22,386 analytical records contained in the final dataset, covering 2,813 unique colleges, 33 states, 7 engineering branches, 26 categories, 7 ownership types and 4 tiers. The analysis is descriptive and associative in nature; it does not involve inferential statistical hypothesis testing, predictive modelling or causal inference. The Power BI component covers dashboard design, KPI definition and DAX measures built directly on this dataset.)
