3110 0 obj
<<
/Title (Recruiters currently face difficulty in identifying which colleges and branches are genuinely recruiter- ready, since publicly available information is often limited to college reputation, historical brand perception or isolated placement percentage figures without further context. Similarly, placement cells and college management often lack a structured, comparative view of how their institution performs relative to peer institutions across tier, branch, state, category and ownership. Students, in turn, often lack visibility into branch-level and skill-related employability patterns when making academic and career decisions. This project is intended to address these informational gaps using a single, cleaned analytical dataset and an associated Power BI decision-support layer.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3091 0 R
>>
endobj
