<<
/Title (While placement percentage and salary figures for individual colleges are often available in isolation, a consolidated, cleaned, multi-dimensional dataset that jointly analyzes placement, employability, internship participation, salary, branch, tier, state, category, ownership and skill-alignment fields combined with a recruiter-oriented Power BI decision-support layer is comparatively uncommon. This project addresses that specific combination.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3095 0 R
>>
